/* pcap_stream binary API.
 *
 * v0.1: empty — the plugin is driven entirely through the text
 * control socket at /run/vpp/pcap-stream.sock. We declare a version
 * message anyway so the plugin appears in `vppctl show api message`
 * and can be recognised by binding generators.
 *
 * Future binary-API surface (probably): create_session,
 * delete_session, list_sessions, get_session_stats. Driving these
 * via vpp_papi from Python tooling is the main motivator for adding
 * them later.
 */

option version = "0.1.0";
